<p>
	To achieve the same design for the Call to Action row as on our Bolts Construction home page, click on the <b>Layout</b> tab and set the <b>Bottom Margin</b> to <b>62</b>px, <b>Padding</b> to <b>60</b>px and the <b>Row Layout</b> to <b>Full Width</b>. Then click on the <b>Design</b> tab and set the <b>Background Color</b> to <b>#292929</b>.
</p>
